Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:26.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the ultimate exclamation point to conquer the China Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N征服中网 最有力的一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:29.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}个星期 {\fs78}8{\fs68}座城市 九站比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:32.91,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年的中国赛季 从成都的秋雨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.85,TL,,0,0,0,,一直打到香港的海风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:37.44,TL,,0,0,0,,九站比赛 打出了{\fs78}5{\fs68}个首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:40.17,TL,,0,0,0,,有人在这里拿到职业生涯第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:41.07,TL,,0,0,0,,有人在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:43.54,TL,,0,0,0,,把丢掉的东西重新赢了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.02,TL,,0,0,0,,这是一个关于 第一次 的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.89,0:00:53.52,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛夜 郑钦文的一发频频出界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:55.98,TL,,0,0,0,,整场都在和自己的一发较劲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:58.57,TL,,0,0,0,,她的 {\fs78}Ace{\fs68} 比对手还少{\fs78}3{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.89,0:01:02.19,TL,,0,0,0,,可只要一发进区
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.19,0:01:04.03,TL,,0,0,0,,她得分的把握就压过对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.03,0:01:05.53,TL,,0,0,0,,二发也更稳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:07.57,TL,,0,0,0,,这不是一场靠发球赢的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:09.24,TL,,0,0,0,,这是一场靠接发和底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:11.29,TL,,0,0,0,,一分一分抠回来的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:15.32,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘第十局 {\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:16.83,TL,,0,0,0,,两个盘点压在头顶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.25,TL,,0,0,0,,平分之后 对手又拿到第三个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:20.87,TL,,0,0,0,,她一个一个全部救回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:22.10,TL,,0,0,0,,然后连赢{\fs78}11{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:23.71,TL,,0,0,0,,顺手带走第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:26.55,TL,,0,0,0,,排名第{\fs78}54{\fs68}位的外卡 站在她对面的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:28.98,TL,,0,0,0,,是世界前五的安德烈耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:30.23,TL,,0,0,0,,整座钻石球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.23,0:01:32.52,TL,,0,0,0,,先是鸦雀无声 然后炸开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:35.12,TL,,0,0,0,,第{\fs78}11{\fs68}分 她用 {\fs78}Ace{\fs68} 收下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:37.09,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}到{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 一局球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:39.44,TL,,0,0,0,,改写了整场决赛的走向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.37,0:02:00.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a way to cap it off for their first ace, and Zheng Qinwen will have them out of their seats in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}Ace{\fs68} 收官！全场起立欢呼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:04.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}They're starting to realize they're on the precipice of history at the China Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他们意识到 历史近在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:10.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The first Chinese player to reach the final is one set from lifting the trophy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首进中网决赛 只差一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:36.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the ultimate exclamation point to conquer the China Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N征服中网 最有力的一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.69,0:02:38.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:39.85,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2011{\fs68}年李娜之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:40.98,TL,,0,0,0,,中国球员第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:43.22,TL,,0,0,0,,捧起{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛的冠军奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:45.25,TL,,0,0,0,,她等这一冠 等了将近两年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:47.94,TL,,0,0,0,,伤病 手术 复出 这个秋天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:50.04,TL,,0,0,0,,她在主场把答案写完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:50.89,TL,,0,0,0,,郑钦文说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:53.74,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她职业生涯最重要的一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.29,TL,,0,0,0,,而这个秋天 属于中国球员的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.98,TL,,0,0,0,,才刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.39,0:03:01.64,TL,,0,0,0,,同样在北京 {\fs78}16{\fs68}岁的孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:03.51,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下了世界前{\fs78}50{\fs68}的布克沙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:06.62,TL,,0,0,0,,全场只送出{\fs78}3{\fs68}个非受迫性失误
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She wins it in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她赢得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:29.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's the biggest victory of this young 16-year-old's career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十六岁 生涯最大的一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.07,0:03:31.36,TL,,0,0,0,,第三轮面对高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:33.86,TL,,0,0,0,,她一度在首盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.48,TL,,0,0,0,,那一周 她的排名从{\fs78}582{\fs68}位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:39.10,TL,,0,0,0,,一口气跳到{\fs78}418{\fs68}位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:44.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think she's a little bit more mature than I was at 16.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她比我十六岁时更成熟一些
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:46.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think I got a little bit more frustrated than she did,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我当时比她更容易急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:49.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she's an incredible player.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她是个不可思议的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.91,0:03:51.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I knew going in it was going to be a tough match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我知道 这会是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:55.17,TL,,0,0,0,,广州 对蒂莫费娃 决胜盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:58.40,TL,,0,0,0,,对方发球胜赛 赛点 就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:00.34,TL,,0,0,0,,她救下赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.99,TL,,0,0,0,,一路追进抢七 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}个小时{\fs78}41{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:06.74,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次站进巡回赛四强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:11.49,TL,,0,0,0,,这个秋天 故事不只属于中国球员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.49,0:04:12.99,TL,,0,0,0,,福基纳来到成都之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:15.65,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}次打进巡回赛决赛 只赢下一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:16.34,TL,,0,0,0,,这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:18.95,TL,,0,0,0,,是他伤停两个半月后的复出第一站
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:21.33,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对胡尔卡奇 他先下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:23.46,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 被拖进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:25.27,TL,,0,0,0,,没人想到 这个抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:28.34,TL,,0,0,0,,会成为他整个中国赛季的转折点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:32.93,TL,,0,0,0,,抢{\fs78}7{\fs68}局 他一度{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.93,0:04:34.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}个盘点 一个接一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:36.59,TL,,0,0,0,,被他全部救了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:37.86,TL,,0,0,0,,成都的这个夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:40.15,TL,,0,0,0,,从这一刻开始属于他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:54.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Three set points come and go.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三个盘点 一个个溜走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:05:07.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh my goodness, it's so good!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我的天 太漂亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:10.40,TL,,0,0,0,,到了上海 他已经在中国连赢{\fs78}9{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:11.68,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:13.24,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是{\fs78}20{\fs68}岁的霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:14.97,TL,,0,0,0,,这是上海大师赛{\fs78}9{\fs68}年来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:16.94,TL,,0,0,0,,第一场全西班牙决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:19.95,TL,,0,0,0,,先丢一盘 抢七扳回 决胜盘咬住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:22.31,TL,,0,0,0,,他把这场决赛 打成了自己的履历
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:24.96,TL,,0,0,0,,从不轻松 但从不放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:34.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alejandro Davidovich Fokina claims a maiden Masters 1000 title in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳 首夺大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:43.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A maiden Masters 1000 title in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他的第一个大师赛冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.54,0:05:49.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A week where he has proved his resilience.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周 他证明了韧性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:06:04.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I cannot describe these kind of moments, how to say to my team, what we achieved during this year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N无法形容 我们做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:08.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was not an easy one, many injuries,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一年不容易 伤病不断
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:12.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but we keep believing,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我们一直相信
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:12.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}you were believing in me all year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你们也相信了我一整年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:15.00,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉的故事更安静
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.66,TL,,0,0,0,,赫瓦林斯卡 半决赛掀翻斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:20.75,TL,,0,0,0,,整场{\fs78}19{\fs68}个制胜分 只送{\fs78}7{\fs68}个失误
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:23.24,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛先丢一盘 又是逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:24.94,TL,,0,0,0,,她的职业生涯第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:26.77,TL,,0,0,0,,直接是{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:37.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Chwalinska seals the deal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡 拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:43.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}They're both vying for a WTA 1000 title, each seeking all the glory in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两人都为一千赛冠军而战
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:45.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Why not just make it best of one set?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N解说调侃 干脆一盘决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:52.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, and the energy, it means a lot, so I really enjoyed my time here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这里的能量 我很享受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:53.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was my first time as well,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是我第一次来武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}definitely not the last.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但肯定不是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.27,TL,,0,0,0,,宁波是另一个极端
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.53,TL,,0,0,0,,世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:07:00.10,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:02.29,TL,,0,0,0,,整场没有丢过一个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.29,0:07:04.64,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她职业生涯第一次成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.30,TL,,0,0,0,,也是她登顶世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:08.00,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到的第一座冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:11.52,TL,,0,0,0,,宁波的八连胜 从去年一直续到今年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:27.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elena Rybakina goes back to back in Ningbo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜在宁波 成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:29.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's amazing to play in front of you,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在你们面前打球太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:31.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}always gives a lot of motivation, a lot of energy to keep on playing,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N给我很多动力 很多能量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:37.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it's already a second year here, second win,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二年来 第二次夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:39.30,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it's such a special place for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这里对我是个特别的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:40.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you so much.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:42.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ningbo, xie xie.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N宁波 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.43,TL,,0,0,0,,北京属于德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:46.22,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛首盘抢七拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:48.57,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 德米纳尔因伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:51.46,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}34{\fs68}胜{\fs78}0{\fs68}负 第七座中网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:53.74,TL,,0,0,0,,职业生涯第{\fs78}102{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:56.40,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}年之后 他又站回了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:58.39,TL,,0,0,0,,可在半决赛 这座球场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:08:01.71,TL,,0,0,0,,刚刚见证过这个秋天最失控的一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a brilliant combination from Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约打出漂亮的组合球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:12.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can you believe it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你敢相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:15.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After the most extraordinary level in this match,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场高水准比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:18.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it has ended on a Medvedev default.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦杰夫被取消资格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:25.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But I was also quite aware that reality is a little bit different these days,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我也清楚 现实已不同
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:27.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}11 years later,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十一年过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:30.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and this year has been quite challenging for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今年对我来说很不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:36.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Lots of ups and downs and physical and health issues, et cetera.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N起伏不断 还有健康问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:41.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I was just trying to find a good feeling on the court,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我只是努力在场上找回感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:46.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and obviously I know that when I'm feeling well and striking the ball well,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当我状态好 击球顺的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:47.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I can still compete at the highest level.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我依然能站在最高水平竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:51.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This week has been an evidence to that, to be honest.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说实话 这一周证明了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:51.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm very proud.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我很骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:54.05,TL,,0,0,0,,杭州 梅德韦杰夫{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:55.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}赢下卢布列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:58.15,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}23{\fs68}个 {\fs78}Ace{\fs68} 赛季第三冠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:00.04,TL,,0,0,0,,中国赛季的男单版图里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.97,TL,,0,0,0,,他是最稳的那一个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:04.05,TL,,0,0,0,,布云朝克特在{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.05,0:09:07.08,TL,,0,0,0,,输给萨菲乌林 没能更进一步
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.81,TL,,0,0,0,,刘婧文的秋天 是从一次退赛开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.81,0:09:13.08,TL,,0,0,0,,广州站 西尼亚科娃因伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:15.28,TL,,0,0,0,,她不战而胜进到{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:16.22,TL,,0,0,0,,最后捧杯的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:18.26,TL,,0,0,0,,是从资格赛打上来的达特
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.05,TL,,0,0,0,,有时候 故事翻篇的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:21.70,TL,,0,0,0,,是先递给你一张轮空签
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.35,TL,,0,0,0,,再看你接不接得住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:25.70,TL,,0,0,0,,广州她止步八强 没人记住她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:28.00,TL,,0,0,0,,香港 她要让所有人记住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.85,TL,,0,0,0,,一周后 她站到了决赛场上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:34.92,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:37.36,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}之后 她连赢{\fs78}9{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:39.61,TL,,0,0,0,,整整一周 一盘未丢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:43.02,TL,,0,0,0,,她的第一个冠军 来得安静 又干脆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:10:07.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Claire Liu has done it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刘婧文 做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:10.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has her first main tour title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的第一个巡回赛冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:15.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Coaches on her feet.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N教练团队都站了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:18.12,TL,,0,0,0,,九站比赛 {\fs78}9{\fs68}座冠军奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:20.90,TL,,0,0,0,,这个秋天 有人从外卡打成冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:23.84,TL,,0,0,0,,有人把{\fs78}10{\fs68}连胜打成大师赛奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:25.94,TL,,0,0,0,,有人决赛先丢一盘再逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:27.57,TL,,0,0,0,,还有人在退赛的阴影里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:30.97,TL,,0,0,0,,等来自己的第一冠 九站 {\fs78}5{\fs68}个首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.97,0:10:32.45,TL,,0,0,0,,郑钦文 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:34.62,TL,,0,0,0,,赫瓦林斯卡 孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.27,TL,,0,0,0,,中国赛季的 {\fs78}MVP{\fs68} 你选谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:39.56,TL,,0,0,0,,评论区 留下你的答案
